#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_doom.html.heex:129
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "DOOM was installed on more PCs than Windows 95 at the time of its release — Bill Gates considered buying id Software."
msgstr "DOOMは発売当時、Windows 95よりも多くのPCにインストールされました。Bill Gatesはid Softwareの買収を検討したほどです。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_scummvm_dreamweb.html.heex:52
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
